 "今では": "الْآنَ, حَالًا (At the present time.) / بِمَا أَنّ, أَمَا وَأَنّ (Since, because, in light of the fact.)  [now]",
 "今でも": "سَاكِن, ثَابِت (Not moving; calm.) / سَاكِنًا (Without motion.) / لَا يَزَال, مَا زَالَ (Up to a time, as in the preceding time.) / رَغِم ذٰلِك, مَعَ ذٰلِك (Nevertheless.)  [still]\nمثال: 私は今でも彼女の名を覚えている。\n→ I still bear her name in mind.",
 "今となっては": "الْآنَ, حَالًا (At the present time.) / بِمَا أَنّ, أَمَا وَأَنّ (Since, because, in light of the fact.)  [now]",
 "今どき": "الْيَوْمَ, النهارده (On the current day or date.) / حَاضِر, الأيام دي (In the current era; nowadays; these days.) / الْيَوْم (today (noun)) / النهرده (today (noun)) / اليوم (today (noun)) / اليوم (today (noun)) / هاد النهار (today (noun))  [today]\nمثال: いまどきそんなことは子供だってしないだろう。\n→ A child today would not do that. / [at this time (of day) ; at this hour]",
 "今なお": "سَاكِن, ثَابِت (Not moving; calm.) / سَاكِنًا (Without motion.) / لَا يَزَال, مَا زَالَ (Up to a time, as in the preceding time.) / رَغِم ذٰلِك, مَعَ ذٰلِك (Nevertheless.)  [still]",
 "今にして": "الْآنَ, حَالًا (At the present time.) / بِمَا أَنّ, أَمَا وَأَنّ (Since, because, in light of the fact.)  [(only) now (doing, occurring, etc.)]\nesp. 今にして思えば",
 "今になって": "الْآنَ, حَالًا (At the present time.) / بِمَا أَنّ, أَمَا وَأَنّ (Since, because, in light of the fact.)  [(only) now]\nمثال: 長いこと贅沢三昧に暮らしていた彼らが、今になって何もない質素な生活に耐えるなんてとても無理な話だ。\n→ They lived high on the hog for so long, and now they can't adjust to a simple life without luxuries.",
 "今のうち": "الْآنَ, حَالًا (At the present time.) / بِمَا أَنّ, أَمَا وَأَنّ (Since, because, in light of the fact.)  [now (while the time is ripe)]\nusu. ～に\nمثال: 今のうちにそれをしなさい。\n→ Do it when you have time.",
 "今のとこ": "حَالِيًّا (At this moment, at present, now.)  [currently]",
 "今のところ": "حَالِيًّا (At this moment, at present, now.)  [currently]\nمثال: 今のところお金はいらない。\n→ I don't need money at present.",
 "今の内": "الْآنَ, حَالًا (At the present time.) / بِمَا أَنّ, أَمَا وَأَنّ (Since, because, in light of the fact.)  [now (while the time is ripe)]\nusu. ～に\nمثال: 今のうちにそれをしなさい。\n→ Do it when you have time.",
 "今の所": "حَالِيًّا (At this moment, at present, now.)  [currently]\nمثال: 今のところお金はいらない。\n→ I don't need money at present.",
 "今はこれまで": "وَاجِب (Impossible to avoid; bound to happen.)  [unavoidable]",
 "今はなき": "غَادَرَ, رَحَلَ (To leave.)  [departed]",
 "今はむかし": "كَان يَامَا كَان (A long time ago; at some time in the past (a traditional beginning of children's)  [once upon a time]",
 "今は亡き": "غَادَرَ, رَحَلَ (To leave.)  [departed]",
 "今は昔": "كَان يَامَا كَان (A long time ago; at some time in the past (a traditional beginning of children's)  [once upon a time]",
 "今は是まで": "وَاجِب (Impossible to avoid; bound to happen.)  [unavoidable]",
 "今は是迄": "وَاجِب (Impossible to avoid; bound to happen.)  [unavoidable]",
 "今は此れ迄": "وَاجِب (Impossible to avoid; bound to happen.)  [unavoidable]",
 "今は無き": "ضَائِع (unable to find one's way) / مَفْقود (unable to find one's way)  [lost]",
 "今ひとつ": "آخَر, إِضَافِيّ (One more further, in addition to the quantity by then; a second or additional on) / آخَر, أُخْرَى (Not the same; different.)  [another (one)] / كَافٍ (sufficient) / تَمَامًا (Sufficiently.) / مَه, كَفَى (Stop! Don't do that any more! It is too much!)  [(not) enough]\nمثال: 新しい車の調子がいま一つです。操縦がきかない。\n→ I had trouble with the new car. It was difficult to steer.",
 "今ほど": "[as (much as) it is now ; as much as the present]\nusu. with negative sentence\nمثال: 学生時代は彼は今ほど優しくなかった。\n→ In his school days he wasn't as gentle as he is now. / آنِفاً (Very close to the present moment; just a moment ago.)  [just now]",
 "今までで": "حتّى الآن (Until now; until the present time.)  [to date]\nusu. used in superlative clauses together with 一番, 最も, 最悪, etc.\nمثال: 今まででお客は５人だけです。\n→ Up to now, only five guests have arrived.",
 "今までにない": "غَيْر مَسْبُوق (Never before seen, done, or experienced; without precedent.)  [unprecedented]\nمثال: 彼は今までにないほどに勤勉だ。\n→ He is as diligent a man as ever lived.",
 "今も": "سَاكِن, ثَابِت (Not moving; calm.) / سَاكِنًا (Without motion.) / لَا يَزَال, مَا زَالَ (Up to a time, as in the preceding time.) / رَغِم ذٰلِك, مَعَ ذٰلِك (Nevertheless.)  [still]\nمثال: それに関する私の記憶は今も鮮やかに残っている。\n→ My memory of that is still vivid.",
 "今もって": "سَاكِن, ثَابِت (Not moving; calm.) / سَاكِنًا (Without motion.) / لَا يَزَال, مَا زَالَ (Up to a time, as in the preceding time.) / رَغِم ذٰلِك, مَعَ ذٰلِك (Nevertheless.)  [still]",
 "今もなお": "سَاكِن, ثَابِت (Not moving; calm.) / سَاكِنًا (Without motion.) / لَا يَزَال, مَا زَالَ (Up to a time, as in the preceding time.) / رَغِم ذٰلِك, مَعَ ذٰلِك (Nevertheless.)  [still]",
 "今も尚": "سَاكِن, ثَابِت (Not moving; calm.) / سَاكِنًا (Without motion.) / لَا يَزَال, مَا زَالَ (Up to a time, as in the preceding time.) / رَغِم ذٰلِك, مَعَ ذٰلِك (Nevertheless.)  [still]",
 "今や": "الْآنَ, حَالًا (At the present time.) / بِمَا أَنّ, أَمَا وَأَنّ (Since, because, in light of the fact.)  [now (esp. in contrast to the past)]\nمثال: トムはいまや以前にもまして勤勉に働いている。\n→ Tom works more diligently now.",
 "今を去る": "قَبْلَ (Before now, before the present time)  [ago]",
 "今を去ること": "قَبْلَ (Before now, before the present time)  [ago]",
 "今んとこ": "حَالِيًّا (At this moment, at present, now.)  [currently]",
 "今一つ": "آخَر, إِضَافِيّ (One more further, in addition to the quantity by then; a second or additional on) / آخَر, أُخْرَى (Not the same; different.)  [another (one)] / كَافٍ (sufficient) / تَمَامًا (Sufficiently.) / مَه, كَفَى (Stop! Don't do that any more! It is too much!)  [(not) enough]\nمثال: 新しい車の調子がいま一つです。操縦がきかない。\n→ I had trouble with the new car. It was difficult to steer.",
 "今一歩": "آخَر, إِضَافِيّ (One more further, in addition to the quantity by then; a second or additional on) / آخَر, أُخْرَى (Not the same; different.)  [another] / [not quite]\nمثال: 監督はチームをトーナメント優勝に今一歩という所までもっていったのに悔しいことだった。\n→ It was annoying, as the manager took his team to a near-miss in the tournament. / [close run ; just falling short of success]",
 "今以て": "سَاكِن, ثَابِت (Not moving; calm.) / سَاكِنًا (Without motion.) / لَا يَزَال, مَا زَالَ (Up to a time, as in the preceding time.) / رَغِم ذٰلِك, مَعَ ذٰلِك (Nevertheless.)  [still]",
 "今回": "الْآنَ, حَالًا (At the present time.) / بِمَا أَنّ, أَمَا وَأَنّ (Since, because, in light of the fact.)  [now]\nمثال: 今回はしくじれないぞ。\n→ You cannot fail this time.",
 "今夕": "هٰذَا الْمَسَاء, اللَّيْلَ (During the night following the current day; during the evening of today.) / اَللَّيْلَة (The nighttime of the current day or date; this night.)  [tonight]\nمثال: 雨が降っているから、今夕は早めに暗くなるでしょう。\n→ It will get dark earlier this evening, as it is raining.",
 "今夜": "هٰذَا الْمَسَاء, اللَّيْلَ (During the night following the current day; during the evening of today.) / اَللَّيْلَة (The nighttime of the current day or date; this night.)  [tonight]\nمثال: 今夜、パーティーを開きます。\n→ We're giving a party tonight.",
 "今宵": "هٰذَا الْمَسَاء, اللَّيْلَ (During the night following the current day; during the evening of today.) / اَللَّيْلَة (The nighttime of the current day or date; this night.)  [tonight]\nمثال: 今宵、奈落の王が復活する。\n→ Tonight, the King of Hell returns.",
 "今尚": "سَاكِن, ثَابِت (Not moving; calm.) / سَاكِنًا (Without motion.) / لَا يَزَال, مَا زَالَ (Up to a time, as in the preceding time.) / رَغِم ذٰلِك, مَعَ ذٰلِك (Nevertheless.)  [still]",
 "今度": "الْآنَ, حَالًا (At the present time.) / بِمَا أَنّ, أَمَا وَأَنّ (Since, because, in light of the fact.)  [now]\nمثال: 今度だけは遅刻を大目に見てやろう。\n→ I will overlook your lateness this time. / قَرِيبًا, سَرْعَانَ مَا (Within a short time; quickly.)  [soon]\nمثال: 今度ロンドンにいらっしゃったときには私たちのところにお立ち寄り下さい。\n→ Please drop in to see us next time you come to London. / مُؤَخَّرًا (in the recent past) / حَدِيثًا (in the recent past) / بِأَخَرَة (in the recent past)  [recently]",
 "今後": "مِنَ الآنَ فَصَاعِدًا, اِنْطِلَاقًا مِنَ الْآنِ (Starting from this moment and continuing indefinitely.)  [from now on]\nمثال: 今後気をつけなくてはなりません。\n→ You must be careful from now on.",
 "今後とも": "مِنَ الآنَ فَصَاعِدًا, اِنْطِلَاقًا مِنَ الْآنِ (Starting from this moment and continuing indefinitely.)  [from now on]\nمثال: 今後ともよろしくお願いいたします。\n→ Please continue your favors towards us.",
 "今後共": "مِنَ الآنَ فَصَاعِدًا, اِنْطِلَاقًا مِنَ الْآنِ (Starting from this moment and continuing indefinitely.)  [from now on]\nمثال: 今後ともよろしくお願いいたします。\n→ Please continue your favors towards us.",
 "今思えば": "فِي وَقْت لَاحِق (When looked back upon as a past event; as can be seen now, but not at the time.)  [in retrospect]",
 "今日": "الْيَوْمَ, النهارده (On the current day or date.) / حَاضِر, الأيام دي (In the current era; nowadays; these days.) / الْيَوْم (today (noun)) / النهرده (today (noun)) / اليوم (today (noun)) / اليوم (today (noun)) / هاد النهار (today (noun))  [today]\nمثال: その事故は去年の今日、起きたのだ。\n→ The accident happened a year ago today. / مُؤَخَّرًا (in the recent past) / حَدِيثًا (in the recent past) / بِأَخَرَة (in the recent past)  [recently]\nمثال: 今日ますます多くの人が、都会より田舎の生活を好むようになっています。\n→ Nowadays more and more people prefer country life to city life.",
 "今日このごろ": "مُؤَخَّرًا (in the recent past) / حَدِيثًا (in the recent past) / بِأَخَرَة (in the recent past)  [recently]",
 "今日この頃": "مُؤَخَّرًا (in the recent past) / حَدِيثًا (in the recent past) / بِأَخَرَة (in the recent past)  [recently]",
 "今日た": "الْيَوْمَ, النهارده (On the current day or date.) / حَاضِر, الأيام دي (In the current era; nowadays; these days.) / الْيَوْم (today (noun)) / النهرده (today (noun)) / اليوم (today (noun)) / اليوم (today (noun)) / هاد النهار (today (noun))  [today]\nemphatic; used in Japanese theater / مُؤَخَّرًا (in the recent past) / حَدِيثًا (in the recent past) / بِأَخَرَة (in the recent past)  [recently]",
 "今日は": "آلُو, آلُوْ (A greeting used when answering the telephone.) / هَل مِن أَحَدٍ هُنَا؟ (A call for response if it is not clear if anyone is present or listening, or if )  [hello]\nは is pronounced as わ\nمثال: こんにちは、ぼくの名前は斎藤健です。\n→ Hi, my name is Ken Saitou.",
 "今日も今日とて": "يَوْمًا بَعْدَ يَوْم (For an indefinite number of days.)  [day after day]",
 "今日的": "عَصْرِيّ, حَدِيث (Pertaining to a current or recent time and style; not ancient.)  [modern]",
 "今時": "الْيَوْمَ, النهارده (On the current day or date.) / حَاضِر, الأيام دي (In the current era; nowadays; these days.) / الْيَوْم (today (noun)) / النهرده (today (noun)) / اليوم (today (noun)) / اليوم (today (noun)) / هاد النهار (today (noun))  [today]\nمثال: いまどきそんなことは子供だってしないだろう。\n→ A child today would not do that. / [at this time (of day) ; at this hour]",
 "今晩": "هٰذَا الْمَسَاء, اللَّيْلَ (During the night following the current day; during the evening of today.) / اَللَّيْلَة (The nighttime of the current day or date; this night.)  [tonight]\nمثال: 今晩は少し熱っぽいのです。\n→ I feel a bit feverish tonight.",
 "今晩は": "مَسَاء الْخَيْر, مَسَاء النُّور (Used as a greeting in the evening.)  [good evening]\nは is pronounced as わ",
 "今暁": "هٰذَا الصَّبَاح (The morning of today.)  [this morning (at dawn)]",
 "今更": "الْآنَ, حَالًا (At the present time.) / بِمَا أَنّ, أَمَا وَأَنّ (Since, because, in light of the fact.)  [now (when it is already much too late)]\nمثال: 今更後悔しても無駄だ。\n→ It's no use regretting it now. / مَرَّة ثَانِيَة (Again, once more; afresh, in a new way, newly.)  [anew]",
 "今更ながら": "[although at this late hour ; now, although it is too late] / مَرَّة ثَانِيَة (Again, once more; afresh, in a new way, newly.)  [anew]",
 "今朝": "هٰذَا الصَّبَاح (The morning of today.)  [this morning]\nمثال: 今朝はとても寒かった。\n→ It was very cold this morning.",
 "今朝がた": "هٰذَا الصَّبَاح (The morning of today.)  [this morning]",
 "今朝方": "هٰذَا الصَّبَاح (The morning of today.)  [this morning]",
 "今次": "جَدِيد (recently made or created) / حَدِيث (recently made or created) / جديد (recently made or created) / جَديد (recently made or created) / جديد (recently made or created) / جديد (recently made or created)  [new]",
 "今現在": "آنِفاً (Very close to the present moment; just a moment ago.)  [just now]",
 "今直ぐ": "حَالاً (Immediately; now; right away.)  [at once]\nمثال: いいえ、今すぐに行く必要はありません。\n→ No, you needn't go right now.",
 "今直ぐにでも": "فِي أَقْرَب وَقْت مُمْكِن, فِي أَسْرَع وَقْت مُمْكِن (As soon as is possible; at one's earliest convenience; at the earliest possible )  [as soon as possible]\nمثال: 彼は今すぐにでも戻るべきだ。\n→ He should be back any minute now.",
 "今程": "[as (much as) it is now ; as much as the present]\nusu. with negative sentence\nمثال: 学生時代は彼は今ほど優しくなかった。\n→ In his school days he wasn't as gentle as he is now. / آنِفاً (Very close to the present moment; just a moment ago.)  [just now]",
 "今般": "الْآنَ, حَالًا (At the present time.) / بِمَا أَنّ, أَمَا وَأَنّ (Since, because, in light of the fact.)  [now]",
 "今風": "عَصْرِيّ, حَدِيث (Pertaining to a current or recent time and style; not ancient.)  [modern]",
 "介して": "عَبْر (From one side or end of (something) to the other.) / خِلَالَ, عَبْرَ (From one side or end of (something) to the other.) / فِي (Amidst or surrounded by (while moving).) / بِوَاسِطَة (By means of.)  [through (the medium of)]\nas ...を介して",
 "介す": "[to use as an intermediary ; to mediate] / قَلِقَ (To be troubled; to give way to mental anxiety or doubt.) / قَلَق (A strong feeling of anxiety.)  [to worry]",
 "介する": "[to use as an intermediary] / قَلِقَ (To be troubled; to give way to mental anxiety or doubt.) / قَلَق (A strong feeling of anxiety.)  [to worry]\nas 意に介する\nمثال: 彼はどんな忠告も意に介さない。\n→ He doesn't heed any advice.",
 "介入": "تَدَخُّل, تَطَفُّل (The action of intervening; interfering in some course of events.)  [intervention]\nمثال: このテーマに関するほとんどの研究では、立法府の介入が悪影響をもたらしたということが示されている。\n→ It has been shown in most studies on this subject that intervention of the legislature had adverse effects.",
 "介助": "مُسَاعَدَة, مَعُونَة (Action given to provide assistance; aid.) / مُسَاعِد, مُسَاعِدَة (Something or someone which provides assistance with a task.) / سَاعَدَ, عَاوَنَ (To provide assistance to (someone or something).) / مُسَاعَدَة, النَّجْدَة (A cry of distress or an urgent request for assistance.)  [help]",
 "介助者": "مُقَدِّم الرِّعايَة (Someone who regularly looks after another person, either as a job or often throu)  [carer]",
 "介在": "مَوْجُود (That exists, or has existence, especially that exists now.)  [existing (between)]",
 "介抱": "تَمْرِيض (Referring to nurses.) / تَمْرِيض (The process or profession of caring for patients as a nurse.)  [nursing]\nمثال: 他人任せはダメ。ライフセーバーではないが、俺自身が介抱してあげないと。\n→ I can't leave this to others. I'm no lifesaver but if I don't help her myself....",
 "介添え人": "[best man ; groomsman] / ثَانٍ, تاني (Number-two; following after the first one with nothing between them. The ordinal) / ثَانِيَة, ثانية (A unit of time historically and commonly defined as a sixtieth of a minute which)  [second (e.g. in a duel)]",
 "介添人": "[best man ; groomsman] / ثَانٍ, تاني (Number-two; following after the first one with nothing between them. The ordinal) / ثَانِيَة, ثانية (A unit of time historically and commonly defined as a sixtieth of a minute which)  [second (e.g. in a duel)]",
 "介詞": "جَارّ, حَرْف جَرّ (An adposition.)  [preposition (in Chinese)]",
 "介護": "تَمْرِيض (Referring to nurses.) / تَمْرِيض (The process or profession of caring for patients as a nurse.)  [nursing]\nمثال: その老婦人は回復しつつあり、病院から派遣された看護婦によって充分な介護を受けている。\n→ The old woman is getting better and is being taken good care of by a nurse from the hospital.",
 "介護士": "مُقَدِّم الرِّعايَة (Someone who regularly looks after another person, either as a job or often throu)  [carer]",
 "介護者": "مُقَدِّم الرِّعايَة (Someone who regularly looks after another person, either as a job or often throu)  [carer]",
 "介錯": "ضَرَبَ عُنُقَهُ (To deliberately remove the head of; to cut off (someone's) head.)  [beheading (as the ending to a seppuku)] / مُسَاعَدَة, إِمْدَاد (Aid; help; the act or result of assisting.)  [assistance]",
 "介錯人": "[person who beheads someone to end a seppuku] / مُسَاعِد, مُسَاعِدَة (A person who assists or helps someone else.)  [assistant]",
 "仍りて": "إِذَنْ, لِذٰلِكَ (Consequently, by or in consequence of that or this cause; referring to something)  [therefore]",
 "仏": "فَرَنْسَا f or فَرَنْسَة (country) / فَرَنْجَة (country) / فرنسا (country)  [France]",
 "仏さま": "بُوذَا, بُدّ (Siddhartha Gautama, ancient Indian philosopher and teacher who founded Buddhism.)  [(a) Buddha] / [deceased person]",
