 "仕掛ける": "نَجْمَة, اِبْتِدَاء (The beginning of an activity.) / نَجْمَة (The beginning point of a race, a board game, etc.) / بَدَأَ (To begin, commence, initiate.)  [to start] / تَحَدٍّ, التَّحَدِّي (A confrontation; a dare.) / تَحَدٍّ, التَّحَدِّي (A difficult task, especially one that the person making the attempt finds more e)  [to challenge] / وَضَع (To put (something) down, to rest.) / غَرَبَ (Of a heavenly body, to disappear below the horizon of a planet, etc, as the latt) / مَجْمُوعَة, طَقْم (A matching collection of similar things. (Note the similar meaning in Etymology ) / مَجْمُوعَة (Set theory.)  [to set (traps)]\nمثال: 彼はその動物をとらえるためにわなをしかけた。\n→ He set a trap to catch the animal. / [to make a meld call]",
