 "仕損ない": "فَشَل, قُصُور (State or condition of not meeting a desirable or intended objective, opposite of) / فَشَل (An object, person or endeavour in a state of failure, has failed at something or) / عُطْل (Termination of the ability of an item to perform its required function; breakdow)  [failure]",
 "仕方": "طَرِيق, سَبِيل (To do with a place or places.)  [way]\nمثال: あなたはチェスの仕方を知っていますか。\n→ Do you know how to play chess?",
 "仕方がない": "[there's no (other) way]\nمثال: 彼を待つより仕方がない。\n→ All we can do is to wait for him. / وَاجِب (Impossible to avoid; bound to happen.)  [unavoidable]\nمثال: 自分でやったことだから仕方がないね。\n→ You brought it on yourself. / بدون جدوى (Having no purpose; purposeless; unable to effect an aim.)  [pointless]\noft. as 〜ても仕方がない\nمثال: そんなに健康のことを心配しても仕方がない。\n→ There is no sense in your worrying about your health so much. / مُزْعِج (Causing irritation or annoyance; troublesome; vexatious.)  [annoying]\nمثال: 全くあの男は仕方がないうそつきだ。\n→ He is simply a hopeless liar.",
 "仕方ない": "[there's no (other) way] / وَاجِب (Impossible to avoid; bound to happen.)  [unavoidable] / بدون جدوى (Having no purpose; purposeless; unable to effect an aim.)  [pointless]\noft. as 〜ても仕方ない / مُزْعِج (Causing irritation or annoyance; troublesome; vexatious.)  [annoying]",
 "仕方のない": "وَاجِب (Impossible to avoid; bound to happen.)  [unavoidable]\nمثال: 彼は遊んでばかりでしかたのない奴だ。\n→ He is always idling about and good for nothing. / بدون جدوى (Having no purpose; purposeless; unable to effect an aim.)  [pointless]\nusu. as 〜ても仕方のない / مُزْعِج (Causing irritation or annoyance; troublesome; vexatious.)  [annoying] / [cannot stand it ; unbearable]\nas 〜て仕方のない or 〜で仕方のない",
 "仕方書": "وَصْفَة (Now especially, a set of instructions for making or preparing food dishes.)  [recipe]",
 "仕業": "مَأْثُرَة (A brave or noteworthy action; a feat or exploit.)  [deed (esp. negative)]\nمثال: それ、ウィルスの仕業じゃないかな。\n→ That looks like the work of a virus.",
 "仕様": "طَرِيق, سَبِيل (To do with a place or places.)  [way] / مُوَاصَفَة (An explicit set of requirements to be satisfied by a material, product, or servi)  [(technical) specification]\nمثال: 仕様、価格は変更することがあります。\n→ Specifications and price are subject to change.",
