 "仕置き": "عِقَاب, جَزَاء (The act (action) or process of punishing, imposing and/or applying a sanction, t) / عُقُوبَة (A penalty to punish wrongdoing, especially for crime.) / عِقَاب (A suffering by pain or loss imposed as retribution.)  [punishment (esp. spanking a child)]\nusu. お〜 / [criminal punishment (esp. execution; Edo period)]",
