 "仕込": "تَدْرِيب, تَمْرِين (The activity of imparting and acquiring skills.)  [training]\nمثال: にわか仕込みの知識ではその問題は解けなかった。\n→ Hastily acquired knowledge was not enough to solve the problem. / [stocking up ; laying in] / تَحْضِير, إِعْدَاد (The act of preparing or getting ready.)  [preparation (e.g. ingredients)] / [girl studying to become a geisha]",
 "仕込み": "تَدْرِيب, تَمْرِين (The activity of imparting and acquiring skills.)  [training]\nمثال: にわか仕込みの知識ではその問題は解けなかった。\n→ Hastily acquired knowledge was not enough to solve the problem. / [stocking up ; laying in] / تَحْضِير, إِعْدَاد (The act of preparing or getting ready.)  [preparation (e.g. ingredients)] / [girl studying to become a geisha]",
 "仕込む": "ذَيْل (Elongated or trailing portion.) / قَافِلَة (Connected sequence of people or things.) / تَدَرَّبَ, تَمَرَّنَ (To practice an ability.) / دَرَّبَ, درب (To teach and form (someone) by practice; to educate (someone).) / درب, أهل (To improve one's fitness.)  [to train]\nمثال: この猿は、きちんと仕込めばいろいろな芸ができるようになるだろう。\n→ The monkey, trained properly, will be able to do a lot of tricks. / حَصَلَ (To get.) / اِكْتَسَبَ, كَسَبَ (To gain, usually by one's own exertions; to get as one's own.)  [to acquire (information)] / جَرْد, خَزِين (A store or supply.) / مَخْزُون (A store or supply.) / مَرَقَة, حَسَاء (The raw material from which things are made, such as feedstock.) / مَنْثُور (Any of the several species of cruciferous flowers in the genus Matthiola.) / قَنْدَاق (A bar, stick, or rod.)  [to stock] / جَهَّزَ, حَضَّرَ (To make ready for a specific future purpose; to set up; to assemble or equip; to) / اِسْتَعَدَّ, تَأَهَّبَ (To make oneself ready; to get ready, make preparation.)  [to prepare (esp. ingredients for brewing)]",
 "仕返し": "اِنْتِقَام (Violent or otherwise punitive response to an act of harm or perceived injustice;)  [retaliation]\nمثال: この侮辱はきっと仕返しをしてやるから。\n→ I'll get even with you for this insult! / [doing over again ; redoing]",
