 "他": "خَارِج, بره (The part of something that faces out; the outer surface.) / خَارِج (Outdoors.) / خَارِج (On the outside of, not inside (something, such as a building).)  [outside]\nمثال: 彼はほかに情報を求めることにした。\n→ He decided to seek information elsewhere. / آخَر, إِضَافِيّ (One more further, in addition to the quantity by then; a second or additional on) / آخَر, أُخْرَى (Not the same; different.)  [another (person or thing)]\nمثال: 地球は水があるという点でほかの惑星と違う。\n→ The earth is different from the other planets in that it has water. / أَبْعَد (Further away than.) / أَقْصَى (On the far side of.) / بَعْد (Later than; after.) / فَوْق (Greater than; so as to exceed or surpass.) / فَوْقَ (In addition to; supplementing.)  [beyond (one's expectations, imagination, etc.)]\nesp. 外 / اِسْتَثْنَى (To exclude; to specify as being an exception.) / إِلَّا, بِاسْتِثْنَاء (Used to introduce an exception or qualification to something previously stated.) / إِلَّا (Used to introduce a clause, phrase, verb infinitive, adverb or other non-noun co)  [except]\nwith neg. sentence; as ...ほかに...ない, ...するほかない, etc.\nمثال: ここには私のほかに誰もいない。\n→ There's no one but me here.",
 "他に": "غَيْر, آخَر (Other; in addition to previously mentioned items.) / وَإِلَا (For otherwise; or else.)  [else]\nمثال: 他に誰がパーティーに来たの？\n→ Who else came to the party?",
 "他にも": "عِلَاوَة عَلَى ذٰلِكَ, أَضِف إِلَى ذٰلِك (In addition; besides; further; what's more (i.e. to denote additional informatio)  [furthermore]",
 "他人": "آخَرُون (Other people.)  [others]\nمثال: 彼女はもっと他人の言うことを聞くべきだ。\n→ She should listen more to other people. / [unrelated person (i.e. not related by blood)] / غَرِيب, غَرِيبَة (A person whom one does not know; a person who is neither a friend nor an acquain) / أَجْنَبِيّ (An outsider or foreigner.)  [stranger]",
 "他人様": "آخَرُون (Other people.)  [others]",
 "他人行儀": "مَحْجُوز (Set aside for a particular person or purpose; spoken for.)  [reserved]\nمثال: そんな他人行儀な話し方はしないでくれよ。\n→ You don't have to stand on ceremony with me.",
