 "他国": "بَلَد أَجْنَبِيّ (Any country of which one is not a citizen. (This entry is a translation hub.))  [foreign country]\nمثال: いかなる国も他国の内政に干渉してはならない。\n→ No country should interfere in another country's internal affairs. / [another province] / [strange land ; alien land]",
