 "何等か": "بَعْضٌ (A certain number (multiple but not all).) / بَعْض (An indefinite quantity.) / بَعْض (An indefinite amount; a part. Used mostly with abstract and nonliving objects.) / بَعْضٌ (A nonzero, unspecified proportion of (a bounded set of countable things): at lea)  [some]\nمثال: これを解く何らかの方法があるはずだ。\n→ There must be some way to solve this.",
 "何者": "مَن, مين (What person or people; which person or people; asks for the identity of someone;)  [who]\nمثال: そこで、今の人達が何者なのか説明しておきたいと思います。\n→ So I want to explain who these people are.",
 "何者か": "أَحَد (One or some person of unspecified or indefinite identity.)  [someone]\nمثال: 何者かが彼女を浴槽で溺死させた。\n→ Somebody had drowned her in the bathtub.",
 "何處": "أَيْن, فين (In, at or to what place.) / حَيْثُ (The place in, at or to which.) / أَيْن (The place in which something happens.)  [where]\nمثال: あなたはどこでテレビを見ますか。\n→ Where do you watch television? / كَمْ (What amount or quantity of (something stated or implied).)  [how much (long, far)]",
 "余": "آخَر, أُخْرَى (Different.) / آخَر (The other one; the second of two.) / آخَر (Not the one or ones previously referred to.)  [other] / فَوْقَ (Expressing spatial relationship or movement.) / فَوْقَ (Expressing comparison.) / عَلَى (Divided by.)  [over]\nمثال: うるさいなっ！少しの頭痛くらい我慢しろ。余は魔力がすっからかんだ。それもこれも姫のせいだぞ。\n→ Shurrup! Don't make such a fuss over a little headache. I'm flat out of magical power - this is all your fault! / أَي, إِي (The name of the Latin script letter I/i.)  [I]",
 "余す": "أَنْقَذَ, أَنْجَى (To prevent harm or difficulty.) / اِدَّخَرَ (To put aside; to avoid.) / حَفِظَ (To put aside; to avoid.)  [to save]\nمثال: 彼は、旅券を余そうとした。\n→ He tried to save something from his travel expenses.",
 "余り": "بَقِيَّة (A part or parts remaining after some has/have been removed or already occurred.)  [remainder]\nمثال: ぎょうざの具のあまりは？餃子を家で作りましたが、皮が少なかったせいか、具が少し余ってしまいました。\n→ Gyoza stuffing? I made some gyoza at home but, possibly because I didn't have enough dough, I had some of the filling left over. / جِدًّا (To a great extent or degree.)  [(not) very]\nwith neg. sentence\nمثال: それはあまり価値がない。\n→ It's not worth much. / [too much ; excessively]\nesp. as あまりに(も) / الْأُقْصَى, الْأَبْعَد (Of a place, the most remote, farthest or outermost.) / شَدِيد (In the greatest or highest degree; intense.) / غَيْر اِعْتِيَادِيّ (Excessive, or far beyond the norm.) / خَطِير (Drastic, or of great severity.) / مُتَطَرِّف (Of sports, difficult or dangerous; performed in a hazardous environment.) / أَخِير (Ultimate, final or last.)  [extreme]\nمثال: スイートルームのあまりの豪華さにウットリした。\n→ We were entranced by the fabulous suite.",
