 "作り込み": "صَنَعَ, أَنْتَجَ (To make things, usually on a large scale, with tools and either physical labor o)  [manufacturing]",
 "作り込む": "فَعَلَ, صَنَعَ (To create.) / جَعَلَ (To cause to be.) / جَعَلَ (To force to do.) / جَعَلَ (To indicate or suggest to be.)  [to make (with great attention to detail)] / [to build (something) into]",
 "作り飾る": "اِدَّعَى (1. (intransitive or with 'that' clause or 'to' infinitive) T) / زَعَمَ (1. (intransitive or with 'that' clause or 'to' infinitive) T) / تَظَاهَرَ (1. (intransitive or with 'that' clause or 'to' infinitive) T)  [to pretend]",
 "作る": "فَعَلَ, صَنَعَ (To create.) / جَعَلَ (To cause to be.) / جَعَلَ (To force to do.) / جَعَلَ (To indicate or suggest to be.)  [to make]\n造る usu. for large-scale building, manufacturing, etc.; 創る usu. for creating\nمثال: どこへ行っても、彼は必ず友達を作る。\n→ Wherever he may go, he is sure to make friends. / جَهَّزَ, حَضَّرَ (To make ready for a specific future purpose; to set up; to assemble or equip; to) / اِسْتَعَدَّ, تَأَهَّبَ (To make oneself ready; to get ready, make preparation.)  [to prepare (food)]\nمثال: たまごを割らずにオムレツは作れない。\n→ You can't make an omelet without breaking eggs. / رَفَعَ (to cause to rise)  [to raise]\nمثال: あなたの菜園で作れる穀物や野菜を食べて生活する方がずっと安上がりだ。\n→ It's much cheaper to live on grains and vegetables you can grow in your garden. / حَتَّى, إِلَى أَنّ (Until; to, up to; as late as (a given time).) / حَتَّى (Until, until the time that.) / حَرَثَ (To work or cultivate or plough (soil); to prepare for growing vegetation and cro)  [to till]",
 "作中人物": "شَخْصِيَّة (A being involved in the action of a story; a persona.) / خُلْق (Strength of mind; resolution; independence; individuality; moral strength.) / حَرْف, رَمْز (A written or printed symbol, or letter.) / مِحْرَف (One of the basic elements making up a text file or string: a code representing a)  [character (in a novel, film, etc.)]",
 "作付": "نَبَات (An organism that is not an animal, especially an organism capable of photosynthe) / زَرَعَ, غَرَسَ (To place (a seed or plant) in soil or other substrate in order that it may live )  [planting]\nمثال: その土地は今年は作付けしていない。\n→ The land is out of crop this year.",
 "作付け": "نَبَات (An organism that is not an animal, especially an organism capable of photosynthe) / زَرَعَ, غَرَسَ (To place (a seed or plant) in soil or other substrate in order that it may live )  [planting]\nمثال: その土地は今年は作付けしていない。\n→ The land is out of crop this year.",
