 "侍": "مُحَارِب, مُقَاتِل (A person who is actively engaged in battle, conflict or warfare; a soldier or co)  [warrior (esp. of military retainers of daimyos in the Edo period)]\nمثال: 『うぐいす侍』人間愛とユーモア溢れる侍物語。\n→ \"The Nightingale Samurai\" is a samurai tale full of humanity and humour. / [person with a strong backbone ; person that does incredible things]",
