 "侍ふ": "حَضَرَ ((''ambitransitive'') to be present at or regularly go to)  [to attend (a person of high rank)] / كَانَ (As a copulative verb:) / كَانَ هُوَ, هِيَ (As a copulative verb:) / كَانَ (As an intransitive lexical verb:)  [to be] / ذَهَبَ, رَاحَ (To move, either physically or in an abstract sense:) / ذَهَبَ, زَالَ (To pass, to be used up:) / غُو (A strategic board game, originally from China and today also popular in Japan an)  [to go] / [expresses politeness towards the listener]\nafter the -masu stem, or -te form, of a verb; equiv. to modern ございます or ます",
 "侍らす": "عَبَدَ (To provide a service (or, by extension, a product, especially food or drink).) / خَدَمَ (To provide a service (or, by extension, a product, especially food or drink).) / قَدَّمَ (To provide a service (or, by extension, a product, especially food or drink).) / أَرْسَلَ (To lead off with the first delivery over the net in tennis, volleyball, ping pon) / خَدَمَ (To be in military service.) / إِرْسَال (An act of putting the ball or shuttlecock in play in various games.)  [to serve]",
 "侍り": "عَبَدَ (To provide a service (or, by extension, a product, especially food or drink).) / خَدَمَ (To provide a service (or, by extension, a product, especially food or drink).) / قَدَّمَ (To provide a service (or, by extension, a product, especially food or drink).) / أَرْسَلَ (To lead off with the first delivery over the net in tennis, volleyball, ping pon) / خَدَمَ (To be in military service.) / إِرْسَال (An act of putting the ball or shuttlecock in play in various games.)  [to serve] / كَانَ (As a copulative verb:) / كَانَ هُوَ, هِيَ (As a copulative verb:) / كَانَ (As an intransitive lexical verb:)  [to be] / [to humbly do ...]\nafter the -masu stem of a verb",
 "侍る": "عَبَدَ (To provide a service (or, by extension, a product, especially food or drink).) / خَدَمَ (To provide a service (or, by extension, a product, especially food or drink).) / قَدَّمَ (To provide a service (or, by extension, a product, especially food or drink).) / أَرْسَلَ (To lead off with the first delivery over the net in tennis, volleyball, ping pon) / خَدَمَ (To be in military service.) / إِرْسَال (An act of putting the ball or shuttlecock in play in various games.)  [to serve]",
