 "侏儒": "قَزَم (Any member of a race of beings from (especially Scandinavian and other Germanic)) / حَنْدَل, حِنْتَار (A person of short stature, often one whose limbs are disproportionately small in) / قَزَم (A dwarf star.) / قَزَمِيّ (Miniature.)  [dwarf]",
 "侘しい": "بَائِس (In a state of misery: very sad, ill, or poor.)  [miserable]\nمثال: あなたがいなくなったら、この世は本当に侘びしくなるわ。\n→ What a lonely world it would be with you away!",
 "侘びしい": "بَائِس (In a state of misery: very sad, ill, or poor.)  [miserable]\nمثال: あなたがいなくなったら、この世は本当に侘びしくなるわ。\n→ What a lonely world it would be with you away!",
 "供": "صَاحِب, صَاحِبَة (A friend, acquaintance or partner; someone with whom one spends time or accompan)  [companion]\nمثال: 空港までお伴しましょう。\n→ I'll accompany you to the airport.",
