 "供祭": "قُرْبَان (gerund of offer)  [offerings]",
 "供給": "زَوَّدَ (To provide (something), to make (something) available for use.) / تَوْرِيد, تَزْوِيد (The act of supplying.) / ذَخِيرَة (An amount of something supplied.)  [supply]\nمثال: 水は外側から供給された。\n→ Water was supplied from outside. / زَوَّدَ (To provide (something), to make (something) available for use.) / تَوْرِيد, تَزْوِيد (The act of supplying.) / ذَخِيرَة (An amount of something supplied.)  [supply]",
