 "依存": "اِسْتِنَاد (The state of being dependent, of relying upon another.) / إِدْمَان (An irresistible physical or psychological need, especially for a chemical substa)  [dependence]\nمثال: それはすべて天候に依存している。\n→ It all depends on the weather.",
 "依存性": "اِسْتِنَاد (The state of being dependent, of relying upon another.) / إِدْمَان (An irresistible physical or psychological need, especially for a chemical substa)  [dependence]",
 "依存症": "اِسْتِنَاد (The state of being dependent, of relying upon another.) / إِدْمَان (An irresistible physical or psychological need, especially for a chemical substa)  [dependence (on alcohol, drugs, etc.)]\nمثال: 彼女の夫はひどい麻薬依存症だ。\n→ Her husband is heavily dependent on drugs.",
