 "依頼者": "زَبُون, مُشْتَرٍ (A customer, a buyer or receiver of goods or services.) / عَمِيل (The role of a computer application or system that requests and/or consumes the s) / عَمِيل (A person who receives help or services from a professional such as a lawyer or a)  [client]\nمثال: ヘタクソな人は英訳しないでください。英訳依頼者からのお願いです。\n→ Please don't do translations if you're crap at it. This is a plea from the English translation clients.",
