 "価値高い": "قَيِّم, ثَمِين (Having a great value.)  [valuable]",
 "価数": "تكافؤ (The combining capacity of an atom, functional group, or radical determined by th) / تَعَلُّق (The number of arguments that a verb can have, including its subject, ranging fro) / تكافؤ (A one-dimensional value assigned by a person to an object, situation, or state, )  [valence]",
 "価格": "ثَمَن, سِعْر (The cost required to gain possession of something.) / ثَمَن (The cost of an action or deed.)  [price]\nمثال: 価格は需要を反映する。\n→ The price reflects the demand.",
 "価格表": "قَائِمَةُ أَسْعَار (A list of items for sale with their prices.)  [price list]\nمثال: この新製品は価格表から２０％引きで提供する用意がございます。\n→ We can offer these new products at 20% below list price.",
 "価格設定": "ثَمَن, سِعْر (The cost required to gain possession of something.) / ثَمَن (The cost of an action or deed.)  [pricing]",
 "価額": "مَبْلَغ, مِقْدَار (The total, aggregate or sum of material (not applicable to discrete numbers or u) / بَلَغَ (To total or evaluate.)  [amount]",
 "侮り": "اِحْتِقَار, اِزْدِرَاء (The state or act of contemning; the feeling or attitude of regarding someone or )  [contempt]",
 "侮る": "اِزْدِرَاء (A feeling of contempt or scorn.)  [to disdain]\nمثال: 彼は危険を侮った。\n→ He was scornful of the danger.",
 "侮慢": "اِحْتِقَار, اِزْدِرَاء (The state or act of contemning; the feeling or attitude of regarding someone or )  [contempt]",
 "侮蔑": "اِحْتَقَرَ (To feel or display contempt or disdain for something or somebody; to despise.) / استنكف (To reject, turn down with disdain.) / استخف (To scoff, to express contempt.)  [scorn]\nمثال: 家では赤味がかった髪とそばかすのせいで、母が侮蔑を込めて「にんじん」と名付け、皆にもそう呼ばせています。\n→ At home, because of his reddish hair and freckles, his mother scornfully named him \"carrot\" and had everybody else call him that.",
 "侮蔑的": "سَبَّ, شَتَمَ (To be insensitive, insolent, or rude to (somebody); to affront or demean (someon) / إهانة (Action or form of speech deliberately intended to be rude; (countable) a particu)  [insulting]",
 "侮言": "سَبَّ, شَتَمَ (To be insensitive, insolent, or rude to (somebody); to affront or demean (someon) / إهانة (Action or form of speech deliberately intended to be rude; (countable) a particu)  [insult]",
 "侮辱": "سَبَّ, شَتَمَ (To be insensitive, insolent, or rude to (somebody); to affront or demean (someon) / إهانة (Action or form of speech deliberately intended to be rude; (countable) a particu)  [insult]\nمثال: 上司を侮辱するような危険をおかすな。\n→ Don't risk insulting your boss.",
