 "侵す": "غَزَا, اِجْتاحَ (To enter by force, usually in order to conquer.)  [to invade]\nمثال: 自然はあらゆる領域で侵されている。\n→ Nature is under attack on all fronts. / اِخْتَلَسَ, أَزْعَجَ (To intrude unrightfully on someone else’s rights or territory.)  [to encroach] / ضَرَرٌ (Physical injury; hurt; damage.) / ضَرَّ أَضَرَّ (To damage, hurt, or injure something, usually an inanimate object.)  [to harm]",
