 "保存": "مُحَافَظَة (The act of preserving; care to preserve; act of keeping from destruction, decay )  [preservation]\nمثال: 私達は田舎の美しさを保存するべきだ。\n→ We should preserve the beauties of the countryside. / أَنْقَذَ, أَنْجَى (To prevent harm or difficulty.) / اِدَّخَرَ (To put aside; to avoid.) / حَفِظَ (To put aside; to avoid.)  [save (to storage)]\nمثال: 外付けのハードディスクに保存しといて。\n→ Save it on the external hard drive.",
