 "信": "not known in Arabic lands (Any of various crucifers in the genus Lunaria, several of which are grown as orn)  [honesty] / ثِقَة (Confidence in or reliance on some person or quality.) / تْرَسْت, اِئْتِمَان (A group of businessmen or traders organised for mutual benefit to produce and di) / وَثِقَ (To place confidence in, to rely on, to confide in.)  [trust] / إِيمَان, مُعْتَقَد (A conviction about abstractions, ideas, or beliefs, without empirical evidence, ) / إِيمَان, دِين (A religious or spiritual belief system.)  [(religious) faith] / [counter for received messages]",
 "信じがたい": "لا يصدق (Amazing, astonishing; so surprising that one is almost, or figuratively, unable )  [unbelievable]",
 "信じきる": "ثِقَة (Confidence in or reliance on some person or quality.) / تْرَسْت, اِئْتِمَان (A group of businessmen or traders organised for mutual benefit to produce and di) / وَثِقَ (To place confidence in, to rely on, to confide in.)  [to trust (someone completely)]",
 "信じようと信じまいと": "صدق أو لا تصدق (This may be surprising, but it's true.)  [believe it or not]\nمثال: 信じようと信じまいと、それは真実だ。\n→ Believe it or not, that is true.",
