 "候ふ": "عَبَدَ (To provide a service (or, by extension, a product, especially food or drink).) / خَدَمَ (To provide a service (or, by extension, a product, especially food or drink).) / قَدَّمَ (To provide a service (or, by extension, a product, especially food or drink).) / أَرْسَلَ (To lead off with the first delivery over the net in tennis, volleyball, ping pon) / خَدَمَ (To be in military service.) / إِرْسَال (An act of putting the ball or shuttlecock in play in various games.)  [to serve (by a superior's side)] / كَانَ (As a copulative verb:) / كَانَ هُوَ, هِيَ (As a copulative verb:) / كَانَ (As an intransitive lexical verb:)  [to be]\nauxiliary used in place of ある after で or に when forming a copula / فَعَلَ, عَمِلَ (To perform; to execute.) / دُو, دُو (A syllable used in solfège to represent the first and eighth tonic of a major sc)  [to do]\nauxiliary used in place of ます",
