 "偏頭痛": "شَقِيقَة, صُدَاع نِصْفِي (A severe, disabling headache, usually affecting only one side of the head, and o)  [migraine]\nمثال: 偏頭痛がおこったときに対処するだけではなく、普段の生活のなかで、偏頭痛をなるべく防いでいくのも大事なことです。\n→ It's the prevention of migraines during daily life that's important, not dealing with migraines when they occur.",
 "做す": "فَعَلَ, صَنَعَ (To create.) / جَعَلَ (To cause to be.) / جَعَلَ (To force to do.) / جَعَلَ (To indicate or suggest to be.)  [to make]",
 "停める": "وَقَفَ, تَوَقَّفَ (To cease moving.) / أَوْقَفَ, وَقَفَ (To cause (something) to cease moving or progressing.) / تَوَقَّفَ, وَقَّف (To cease; to no longer continue.) / أَوْقَفَ, وَقَفَ (To cause (something) to come to an end.) / مَوْقِف (A (usually marked) place where buses, trams or trains halt to let passengers get) / وَقْفَة (An action of stopping; interruption of travel.)  [to stop]\nesp. 止める, 停める\nمثال: その新聞は政府にインフレを止めるように求めた。\n→ The newspaper called for the government to stop inflation. / حَدِيقَة (An area of land set aside for environment preservation or recreation.) / وَقَّفَ, صَفَّ (To bring (something such as a vehicle) to a halt or store in a specified place.)  [to park]\nesp. 止める, 停める\nمثال: ここに車を停めるのは違法です。\n→ It's illegal to park your car here. / مَنَعَ (To stop (an outcome); to keep from (doing something).)  [to prevent]\nesp. 止める, 停める / وَقَفَ, تَوَقَّفَ (To cease moving.) / أَوْقَفَ, وَقَفَ (To cause (something) to cease moving or progressing.) / تَوَقَّفَ, وَقَّف (To cease; to no longer continue.) / أَوْقَفَ, وَقَفَ (To cause (something) to come to an end.) / مَوْقِف (A (usually marked) place where buses, trams or trains halt to let passengers get) / وَقْفَة (An action of stopping; interruption of travel.)  [to stop (someone from doing something)]\nمثال: この文書はあなたのお目にだけ留めていただきたい。\n→ This document is for your eyes only.",
