 "停戦": "هُدْنَة (A (short) cessation of combat.) / هُدْنَة, وَقْفُ نَار (A formal agreement, especially between nations, to end combat.)  [armistice]\nمثال: この停戦が世界平和に役立つことを私達はみな望んでいる。\n→ We all hope that this cease-fire will make for world peace.",
 "停止": "[stoppage ; coming to a stop]\nمثال: 列車は滑らかに停止した。\n→ The train came to a smooth stop. / زَالَ (To stop doing (something).)  [ceasing (movement, activity, etc.)]\nمثال: コンピューター・システムは午後８時に自動的に停止する。\n→ The computer system shuts down automatically at 8pm. / يُعَلِّق (The act of suspending, or the state of being suspended.) / تَعْلِيق (A temporary or conditional delay, interruption or discontinuation.)  [suspension (of payment, a licence, etc.)]\nمثال: 大統領は憲法を停止し、戒厳令をしきました。\n→ The President suspended the constitution and imposed martial law. / [suspension of music, dance, etc. as a sign of mourning for a prominent person]",
