 "健やか": "صَحِيح, سَلِيم (Enjoying good health; free from disease or disorder.) / صِحِّيّ (Conducive to health.)  [healthy]\nمثال: お宮参りで訪れた大西幸治さん(40)、由希恵さん(34)夫妻は「子どもが健やかに育つことを祈りました」と話していた。\n→ The couple who came on a shrine visit, Kouji Oonishi (40) and his wife Yukie (34) said, \"We prayed that our child would grow up healthily.\"",
