 "催し": "وَاقِعَة, حَادِثَة (An occurrence; something that happens.)  [event]\nمثال: 今日の催しのチケットはありますか。\n→ Do you have any tickets for today's performance?",
 "催し物": "تَرْفِيه, تَسْلِيَة (An activity designed to give pleasure, enjoyment, diversion, amusement, or relax)  [(program of) entertainments]\nمثال: あなたはその催し物がいつ行われたか知っていますか。\n→ Do you know when the event took place?",
 "催す": "مَسَكَ, مسك (To grasp or grip.)  [to hold (an event)]\nمثال: 彼は大々的にパーティーを催した。\n→ He gave a party on a large scale. / تحسس (To use or experience the sense of touch.) / شَعَرَ (To sense or think emotionally or judgmentally.) / شَعَرَ بِ (To sense or think emotionally or judgmentally.)  [to feel (sensation, emotion, call of nature, etc.)]\nمثال: 彼は勉強を始めるとどうして眠気を催すのだろうか。\n→ Why should he feel drowsy whenever he begins to study?",
 "催促": "آلَةُ طِبَاعَة, آلَةُ الطِّبَاعَة (A printing machine.) / صِحَافَة, صَحَافَة (The print-based media (both the people and the newspapers).) / ضَغَطَ (To drive or thrust by pressure, to force in a certain direction.)  [pressing]\nمثال: 催促がましくて恐縮ですが、先日お貸ししたお金を返していただけませんか。\n→ I'm afraid this sounds like a demand, but could you return the money I lent you the other day?",
 "催合う": "نَصِيب, حِصَّة (A portion of something, especially a portion given or allotted to someone.) / سَهْم (A financial instrument that shows that one owns a part of a company that provide) / شَارَكَ (To give part of what one has to somebody else to use or consume.) / شَارَكَ (To divide and distribute.)  [to share]",
 "催告": "إِشْعَار, إِخْطَار (The act of notifying.) / تَنْبِيه, إِشْعَار (A specific piece of information that serves to notify.)  [notification]",
