 "傲岸": "مُتَعَالٍ, الْمُتَعَالِي (Conveying in demeanour the assumption of superiority; disdainful, supercilious.)  [haughty]",
 "傲岸無礼": "تَكَبُّر, غُرُور (The state of being arrogant; a type of extreme or foolish pride in which someone)  [arrogance]",
 "傲慢": "مُتَعَالٍ, الْمُتَعَالِي (Conveying in demeanour the assumption of superiority; disdainful, supercilious.)  [haughty]\nمثال: 彼の態度にはごう慢なところがある。\n→ His manner partakes of insolence.",
