 "傳承": "أُسْطُورَة (An unrealistic story depicting past events.) / مِفْتَاح خَرِيطَة (A key to the symbols and color codes on a map, chart, etc.)  [legend]",
 "傴僂": "أَحْدَب, حَدْبَاء (A person with a humpback; a person who suffers from kyphosis.)  [humpback] / كُسَاح (A disorder of infancy and early childhood due to a deficiency of vitamin D, caus)  [rickets]",
 "債": "دَيْن (An action, state of mind, or object one has an obligation to perform for another) / دَيْن (The state or condition of owing something to another.) / دَيْن, قَرْض (Money that one person or entity owes or is required to pay to another, generally)  [debt]",
