 "債務": "دَيْن (An action, state of mind, or object one has an obligation to perform for another) / دَيْن (The state or condition of owing something to another.) / دَيْن, قَرْض (Money that one person or entity owes or is required to pay to another, generally)  [debt]\nمثال: アメリカの対外債務は５０００億ドルを突破しましたよ。\n→ America's foreign debt shot past $500 billion.",
