 "傷心": "غَمّ, حُزْن (A cause or instance of sorrow or pain; that which afflicts or distresses; a tria)  [grief]\nمثال: 彼は失恋のために傷心した。\n→ He was heartbroken from unrequited love.",
 "傷痍": "جُرْح, جِرَاحَة (An injury, such as a cut, stab, or tear, to a (usually external) part of the bod) / جَرَحَ (To hurt or injure (someone) by cutting, piercing, or tearing the skin.)  [wound]",
 "傷痕": "نَدْبَة, نَدْب (A permanent mark on the skin, sometimes caused by the healing of a wound.)  [scar]\nمثال: 彼のほおの傷あとは今ではほとんどわからない。\n→ The scar on his cheek hardly shows now.",
