 "傷跡": "نَدْبَة, نَدْب (A permanent mark on the skin, sometimes caused by the healing of a wound.)  [scar]\nمثال: 彼のほおの傷あとは今ではほとんどわからない。\n→ The scar on his cheek hardly shows now.",
 "傾": "مُنْحَدَر (An area of ground that tends evenly upward or downward.) / مَيْل (The degree to which a surface tends upward or downward.)  [sloping]\nمثال: えらくご機嫌ななめね、けんか腰にならないで。\n→ Wow, you're really in a bad mood. Don't get scrappy. / شَوَّهَ (To bring something out of shape, to misshape.)  [distorted (feeling)]",
 "傾き": "مُنْحَدَر (An area of ground that tends evenly upward or downward.) / مَيْل (The degree to which a surface tends upward or downward.)  [slope] / مَيْل, نَزَعَة (A likelihood of behaving in a particular way or going in a particular direction;)  [tendency] / مُنْحَدَر (An area of ground that tends evenly upward or downward.) / مَيْل (The degree to which a surface tends upward or downward.)  [slope (of a linear function)]",
