 "元": "مَنْشَأ (The beginning of something.) / مَنْبَع, مَنْشَأ (The source of a river, information, goods, etc.) / اَصْل (Ancestry.)  [origin]\nesp. 元\nمثال: 憲政の危機が始まったのは、このような状況のもとであった。\n→ It was under these circumstances that the constitutional crisis began. / قَاعِدَة, أَسَاس (An underlying condition or circumstance.)  [basis]\noft. 基\nمثال: 私たちは人をその人の人格を基に判断しようと考えるかもしれないが、それらは一見したところでははっきりわからないものである。\n→ Although we may intend to judge a person on the basis of his or her personal qualities, they are not visible at first sight. / قَضِيَّة (A goal, aim or principle, especially one which transcends purely selfish ends.) / سَبَّبَ (To set off an event or action; to bring about; to produce.)  [cause]\nalso written as 因, 原\nمثال: その事務員は過労がもとで死んだ。\n→ The clerk died from overwork. / مَادِّيّ (Of, relating to, or affecting physical well-being; corporeal; bodily.) / مَادَّة (A basic matter (as metal, wood, plastic, fiber, etc.) from which the whole or th)  [(raw) material]\nesp. 素",
