 "元祖": "رَائِد (One who goes before, as into the wilderness, preparing the way for others to fol)  [pioneer] / سَلَف (A forefather, any of a person's direct ancestors.)  [progenitor]",
 "元立ち": "مِذْيَاع, رَادِيُو (An item or apparatus that receives.) / سَمَّاعَة (An item or apparatus that receives.)  [receiver (of an attack during kendo practice)]",
 "元素": "عُنْصُر كِيمِيَائِيّ, عُنْصُر (One of the simplest or essential parts or principles of which anything consists,)  [element]\nمثال: 元素記号Ｈは水素をあらわす。\n→ The chemical symbol H indicates hydrogen. / عُنْصُر كِيمِيَائِيّ, عُنْصُر (One of the simplest or essential parts or principles of which anything consists,)  [(classical) element (e.g. earth, water, air, fire)] / مَنْشَأ (The beginning of something.) / مَنْبَع, مَنْشَأ (The source of a river, information, goods, etc.) / اَصْل (Ancestry.)  [origin]",
 "元締": "مُدِير, مُدِيرَة (A person whose job is to manage something, such as a business, a restaurant, or )  [manager] / [chief treasurer] / رَئِيس, رَئِيسَة (One who is in charge of something.)  [boss (of a gambling den)]",
 "元締め": "مُدِير, مُدِيرَة (A person whose job is to manage something, such as a business, a restaurant, or )  [manager] / [chief treasurer] / رَئِيس, رَئِيسَة (One who is in charge of something.)  [boss (of a gambling den)]",
