 "充つ": "[to be full]\nusu. as 〜に満たない / شَمْع, شَمَع (Any oily, water-resistant, solid or semisolid substance; normally long-chain hyd)  [to wax (e.g. moon)] / نَهَضَ, اِرْتَفْعَ (To move, or appear to move, physically upwards relative to the ground.) / أَشْرَقَ, شَرَقَ (To move, or appear to move, physically upwards relative to the ground.)  [to rise (e.g. tide)] / نَاضِج, رَاشِد (Fully developed; grown up in terms of physical appearance, behaviour or thinking) / نَاضِج (To attain maturity, to become mature or ripe.)  [to mature]",
 "充てがう": "خَصَّصَ (To assign or designate as a task or for a purpose.)  [to allot]\nمثال: こびへつらうウェイターは最上のテーブルをあてがわれる。なぜなら、そうしたウェイターは、いつもマネージャーや上役のきげんをとるから。\n→ The obsequious waiter is usually assigned the best table because he always curries favor with his manager and superiors. / أَعْطَى, وَهَبَ (To move, shift, provide something abstract or concrete to someone or something o)  [to give]\nمثال: 彼に食物をあてがった。\n→ I provided him with food. / [to fit to ; to fasten to]\nمثال: クリスマスの当日になっても、トムの右足には依然としてギブスがあてがわれたままであった。\n→ On Christmas Day, Tom still had his right leg in plaster.",
 "充てる": "تعيين شخص لعمل ما (To designate or set apart (something) for some purpose.)  [to assign]\nمثال: 彼はその金を借金の返済に充てた。\n→ He applied the money to the payment of debts.",
