 "充填物": "حُزْمَة, عُبُوَّة (A bundle made up and prepared to be carried; especially, a bundle to be carried ) / وَضَّبَ (to put things together for storage or transporting) / حَزَمَ (to put things together for storage or transporting)  [packing]",
 "充実": "اِمْتِلَاء (Being full; completeness.)  [fullness]\nمثال: ここ品物は高いけど、その分アフターサービスが充実してるから。\n→ Prices are high here but that's because the after-sale service is really good. / تَحْسِين (The act of improving; advancement or growth; a bettering)  [improvement] / تجديد موارد (The act of replenishing.)  [replenishment]",
 "充当": "تَخْصِيص (The process or procedure for allocating things, especially money or other resour)  [allocation]\nمثال: その金は負債の支払いに充当することになっている。\n→ The money is to be applied to the debt.",
