 "充足": "كِفَايَة (The quality or condition of being sufficient.)  [sufficiency]\nمثال: 彼らは空席を任命で充足した。\n→ They filled the vacancy by appointment.",
 "充電": "تُهْمَة (accusation) / اِتَّهَمَ (To formally accuse (a person) of a crime.) / شَحَنَ (To place a burden, load or responsibility on or in.) / شَحَنَ (To load equipment with material required for its use, as a firearm with powder, ) / هَاجَمَ (To move forward quickly and forcefully, particularly in combat and/or on horseba)  [charging (electrically)]\nمثال: この電池は充電されている。\n→ This battery is charged. / [recharging one's batteries (e.g. by taking a nap) ; replenishing (one's energy)]",
