 "兆候": "لافِتَة (A clearly visible object, generally flat, bearing a short message in words or pi) / وَقَّعَ (To make a mark)  [sign]\nمثال: 私たちはそれらの徴候を常に意識している。\n→ We are always conscious of the signs.",
