 "先": "نُقْطَة (A small dot or mark.) / نُقْطَة (A small discrete division or individual feature of something.) / مَوْقِع (A small discrete division or individual feature of something.) / أَشَارَ (To extend the index finger in the direction of something in order to show where )  [point]\nمثال: 鉛筆の先が丸くなった。\n→ The point of the pencil has become dull. / رَئِيس, رَئِيسَة (The part of the body of an animal or human which contains the brain, mouth, and ) / رَئِيس (A leader or expert.) / اِتَّجَهَ (To move in a specified direction.)  [head (of a line)] / أَوَّل, أُولَى (Coming right after the zeroth in things that use zero-based numbering.) / أَوَّلاً (Before anything else; firstly.) / أَوَّل (The person or thing in the first position.)  [first]\nمثال: 二人の男のうち、背の高い方が先に出ていった。\n→ The taller of the two men went out first. / أَبْعَد (Further away than.) / أَقْصَى (On the far side of.) / بَعْد (Later than; after.) / فَوْق (Greater than; so as to exceed or surpass.) / فَوْقَ (In addition to; supplementing.)  [beyond]\nمثال: この電車は中野より先は各駅に停車する。\n→ This train stops at every station from Nakano on.",
 "先き": "نُقْطَة (A small dot or mark.) / نُقْطَة (A small discrete division or individual feature of something.) / مَوْقِع (A small discrete division or individual feature of something.) / أَشَارَ (To extend the index finger in the direction of something in order to show where )  [point]\nمثال: 鉛筆の先が丸くなった。\n→ The point of the pencil has become dull. / رَئِيس, رَئِيسَة (The part of the body of an animal or human which contains the brain, mouth, and ) / رَئِيس (A leader or expert.) / اِتَّجَهَ (To move in a specified direction.)  [head (of a line)] / أَوَّل, أُولَى (Coming right after the zeroth in things that use zero-based numbering.) / أَوَّلاً (Before anything else; firstly.) / أَوَّل (The person or thing in the first position.)  [first]\nمثال: 二人の男のうち、背の高い方が先に出ていった。\n→ The taller of the two men went out first. / أَبْعَد (Further away than.) / أَقْصَى (On the far side of.) / بَعْد (Later than; after.) / فَوْق (Greater than; so as to exceed or surpass.) / فَوْقَ (In addition to; supplementing.)  [beyond]\nمثال: この電車は中野より先は各駅に停車する。\n→ This train stops at every station from Nakano on.",
 "先ごろ": "مُنْذُ بِضْعَةْ أَيَّام, بِالْأَمْس (Recently; lately; a few days ago.)  [the other day]\nمثال: 先ごろのサービス上の不備について釈明したかった。\n→ We wanted to explain the recent service failure.",
 "先ず": "أَوَّل, أُولَى (Coming right after the zeroth in things that use zero-based numbering.) / أَوَّلاً (Before anything else; firstly.) / أَوَّل (The person or thing in the first position.)  [first (of all)]\nمثال: まず第一に私はジムを訪ねなければならない。\n→ First of all, I have to call on Jim. / مِن اَلْمُحْتَمَل, رُبَّمَا (In all likelihood.)  [probably]\nمثال: あのチームは、あるとしても、まず優勝の望みはない。\n→ That team has little, if any, chance of winning. / حَوَالِي (Approximately.)  [more or less (satisfactory)] / عَلَى كُلِّ حَال, على كل حال (Regardless; anyhow.) / عَلَى أَيُّ حَالٍ, على كل حال (Used to indicate that a statement explains or supports a previous statement. See)  [anyway]",
 "先ずは": "أَوَّلًا, قَبْلَ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ (Firstly; before anything else.)  [first of all]\nmore emphatic than まず\nمثال: まずは公式を暗記しなさい。\n→ First of all, learn the formula by heart. / مِن اَلْمُحْتَمَل, رُبَّمَا (In all likelihood.)  [probably] / حَوَالِي (Approximately.)  [more or less (satisfactory)] / عَلَى كُلِّ حَال, على كل حال (Regardless; anyhow.) / عَلَى أَيُّ حَالٍ, على كل حال (Used to indicate that a statement explains or supports a previous statement. See)  [anyway]",
 "先ずもって": "أَوَّلًا, قَبْلَ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ (Firstly; before anything else.)  [first of all]",
 "先ず以て": "أَوَّلًا, قَبْلَ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ (Firstly; before anything else.)  [first of all]",
 "先ず第一に": "أَوَّلًا, قَبْلَ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ (Firstly; before anything else.)  [first of all]\nمثال: まず第一にここにお招きいただいてとても嬉しく思っている事を述べます。\n→ First of all, let me say how glad I am to be here.",
 "先だって": "مُنْذُ بِضْعَةْ أَيَّام, بِالْأَمْس (Recently; lately; a few days ago.)  [the other day]\nمثال: 先だって彼にあったときには、彼はとても元気だった。\n→ Last I met him, he was very well.",
 "先っちょ": "نِهَايَة, غَايَة (The most extreme point of an object, especially one that is longer than it is wi) / غَايَة (A purpose, goal, or aim.) / اِنْتَهَى, أَنْهَى (To finish, terminate.)  [end]",
 "先っぽ": "طَرَف (extreme end of something) / بَقْشِيش (To give a small gratuity to, especially to an employee of someone who provides a) / بَقْشِيش, بَخْشِيش (A small monetary gift.) / إِخْبَارِيَّة (A piece of private or secret information, especially imparted by someone with ex) / نَصِيحَة (A piece of advice.)  [tip]",
 "先つ祖": "سَلَف (One from whom a person is descended, whether on the father's or mother's side, a)  [ancestor]",
 "先に": "قَبْلًا, قَبْل (At an earlier time; already.)  [previously] / أَوَّل, أُولَى (Coming right after the zeroth in things that use zero-based numbering.) / أَوَّلاً (Before anything else; firstly.) / أَوَّل (The person or thing in the first position.)  [first]\nمثال: 私が先にそこへ着くよ。\n→ I'll get there before you will. / [beforehand ; in advance]\nمثال: その情報は発表するより先に新聞に漏れた。\n→ The information was given away to the newspaper prior to the announcement.",
 "先に立つ": "رَصَاص (A heavy, pliable, inelastic metal element, having a bright, bluish color, but ea) / قَادَ (To guide or conduct.) / أَرْشَدَ, هَدَى (To guide or conduct.)  [to lead] / [to take precedence (e.g. sadness taking precedence over anger)] / [to be most essential]",
 "先の日": "مُنْذُ بِضْعَةْ أَيَّام, بِالْأَمْس (Recently; lately; a few days ago.)  [the other day]",
 "先の祖": "سَلَف (One from whom a person is descended, whether on the father's or mother's side, a)  [ancestor]",
 "先べん": "مُبَادَرَة (A beginning; a first move.) / مُبَادَرَة (A new development; a fresh approach to something; a new way of dealing with a pr) / مُبَادَرَة (The ability to act first or on one's own.)  [initiative]",
 "先ほど": "آنِفاً (Very close to the present moment; just a moment ago.)  [just now]\nمثال: つい先ほど君のお父さんに会いました。\n→ I met your father just now.",
 "先を急ぐ": "عَجَلَة (A rushed action.) / أَسْرَعَ, اِنْدَفَعَ (To do things quickly.)  [to hurry]",
 "先を続ける": "تَابَعَ, اِسْتَمَرَّ (To proceed with (doing an activity); to prolong (an activity).) / تَابَعَ, اِسْتَمَرَّ (To resume.)  [to continue]",
 "先んじる": "سَبَقَ, سَلَفَ (To go before, go in front of.)  [to precede]\nمثال: 彼は遥かに時代を先んじていた。\n→ He was far in advance of his days.",
 "先んずる": "سَبَقَ, سَلَفَ (To go before, go in front of.)  [to precede]",
 "先んずれば人を制す": "مِنْ سَبَق أَكْل النَبْق, مِنْ سَبَقْ شَمْ الحَبْقْ (Whoever arrives first has the best chance of success; some opportunities are ava)  [the early bird gets the worm]",
 "先人": "رَائِد (One who goes before, as into the wilderness, preparing the way for others to fol)  [pioneer]\nمثال: 彼は先人と同じ道を歩むことを名誉だと信じている。\n→ He believes it to be an honor to follow in his predecessor's footsteps.",
 "先付": "مَزَّة, مُشَهْي (A small, light, and usually savory first course in a meal.)  [appetizer] / [later date ; post-dating (e.g. a letter or cheque)]",
 "先付け": "مَزَّة, مُشَهْي (A small, light, and usually savory first course in a meal.)  [appetizer] / [later date ; post-dating (e.g. a letter or cheque)]",
 "先住民": "سَاكِن أَصْلِيّ (A native inhabitant of a country; a member of the original people.)  [aborigines]\nمثال: アメリカ先住民の祖先は、ベーリング海峡を経由してアジアから大陸へ渡った。\n→ The ancestors of Native Americans went to the continent from Asia by way of the Bering Strait.",
 "先住民族": "سَاكِن أَصْلِيّ (A native inhabitant of a country; a member of the original people.)  [aborigines]",
 "先体": "مُقَدِّمَة الْحَيَوَانِ الْمَنَوِيِّ (A structure forming the end of the head of a spermatozoon.)  [acrosome]",
 "先例": "سَابِقَة (An act in the past which may be used as an example to help decide the outcome of)  [precedent]\nمثال: そんな先例はない。\n→ We have no such example.",
 "先入": "إِجْحَاف, تَحَامُل (An adverse judgment or opinion formed beforehand or without knowledge of the fac)  [prejudice]",
 "先入れ先出しリスト": "طابُور, صَفّ (A line of people, vehicles or other objects, usually one to be dealt with in seq) / وَقَفَ فِي الصَّفّ (To put oneself or itself at the end of a waiting line.)  [queue]",
 "先入主": "إِجْحَاف, تَحَامُل (An adverse judgment or opinion formed beforehand or without knowledge of the fac)  [prejudice]",
 "先入見": "إِجْحَاف, تَحَامُل (An adverse judgment or opinion formed beforehand or without knowledge of the fac)  [prejudice]",
 "先入観": "إِجْحَاف, تَحَامُل (An adverse judgment or opinion formed beforehand or without knowledge of the fac)  [prejudice]\nمثال: そういうの、先入観っていうんだよっ！体験したこと無いのに、決め付けるのはよくないっ！\n→ That's what they call 'prejudice'! It's wrong to make your mind up on something you've never experienced!",
 "先公": "[previous ruler ; previous lord] / مُعَلِّم, مُعَلِّمَة (A person who teaches, especially one employed in a school; preceptor.)  [teacher]",
 "先兵": "طَلِيعَة (The leading units at the front of an army or fleet.) / طَلِيعَة (The person or people at the forefront of a group or movement.)  [vanguard]",
 "先出": "الْمَذْكُورُ آنِفًا, السًّابِقُ ذِكْرُهُ (Mentioned or named before; aforesaid.)  [above-mentioned]",
 "先制": "مُبَادَرَة (A beginning; a first move.) / مُبَادَرَة (A new development; a fresh approach to something; a new way of dealing with a pr) / مُبَادَرَة (The ability to act first or on one's own.)  [initiative]\nمثال: 先制の一撃をすれば半分勝ったようなものだ。\n→ The first blow is half the battle.",
 "先刻": "آنِفاً (Very close to the present moment; just a moment ago.)  [just now] / قَد, مِنْ قَبْلُ (Prior to some specified time, either past, present, or future; by this time; pre) / لقد (So soon.)  [already]\nمثال: 先刻承知。\n→ I've known it all along.",
 "先取": "اِسْتِغْرَاق, اِنْهِمَاك (The state of being preoccupied or an idea that preoccupies the mind; enthrallmen)  [preoccupation]",
 "先史": "عَصْر مَا قَبْلَ التَّارِيخ (The time before written records in any area of the world; the events and conditi)  [prehistory]",
 "先史学": "عَصْر مَا قَبْلَ التَّارِيخ (The time before written records in any area of the world; the events and conditi)  [prehistory]",
 "先史時代": "عَصْر مَا قَبْلَ التَّارِيخ (The time before written records in any area of the world; the events and conditi)  [prehistory]",
 "先君": "[previous lord ; late lord] / [(one's) late father] / سَلَف (One from whom a person is descended, whether on the father's or mother's side, a)  [ancestor]",
 "先回": "آخِر (Final, ultimate, coming after all others of its kind.) / مَاضٍ, الْمَاضِي (Most recent, latest, last so far.) / آخر (after everything else; finally) / اِسْتَمَرَّ, دَامَ (To endure, continue over time.)  [the last]\nمثال: 先回は安産でした。\n→ I had an easy delivery last time.",
 "先回り": "تَوَقَّعَ, اِرْتَقَبَ (To know of (something) before it happens; to expect.)  [anticipating]\nمثال: 敵が攻撃しそうなところに先回りして手を打っておいた。\n→ We anticipated where the enemy would attack."
}
